[PrintTextModified Text:結局食事はほとんど喉を通らず、<br>エマは地下に来ていた。|#0104Adv05_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
